  "notes": "FORMS:\n{並|へい} (line up, side by side) + {列|れつ} (row, column) → arranged side by side\n{並列|へいれつ}する (to arrange in parallel)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n{直列|ちょくれつ} (serial, in series)\n- {並列|へいれつ}{回路|かいろ}: Components share voltage, current divides\n- {直列|ちょくれつ}{回路|かいろ}: Components share current, voltage divides\n\nTECHNICAL TERMS:\n- {並列|へいれつ}{回路|かいろ} (parallel circuit)\n- {並列|へいれつ}{処理|しょり} (parallel processing)\n- {並列|へいれつ}{接続|せつぞく} (parallel connection)",
